// Modules of the API reference: one module for each component of the emulator,
// plus a few modules for types that cut across the components. Each entry below
// puts a declaration into a module.
//
// The sidebar lists the modules in the order of GROUP_ORDER in flatten_groups.py,
// which has to be extended when a module is added.

/** @defgroup grp_emulator Emulator
 *  The emulator as a whole: VirtualC64 and C64API, the configuration options, the execution state, the user defaults, and the types shared by all components.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_cpu CPU
 *  The CPU, its debugger, and the breakpoints and watchpoints.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_memory Memory
 *  The memory and the memory debugger.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_vicii VICII
 *  The VICII graphics chip and the X-Ray visualizer.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_sid SID
 *  The SID sound chip.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_cia CIA
 *  The two CIA chips and their time-of-day clocks.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_audiovideo Audio and video
 *  The audio port, the video port, and the monitor emulation.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_controlports Control ports
 *  The control ports and the joysticks, mice, and paddles connected to them.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_expansionport Expansion port
 *  The expansion port, cartridges, REU, and GeoRAM.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_userserial User and serial ports
 *  The user port with the RS232 adapter, the serial (IEC) port, and the power port.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_datasette Datasette
 *  The tape recorder.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_drives Drives
 *  The floppy drives and the disks in them.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_keyboard Keyboard
 *  The keyboard and the keys of the C64.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_retroshell RetroShell
 *  The command console.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_remoteservers Remote servers
 *  The remote servers and their traffic log.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_messages Messages
 *  The messages the emulator sends to the front-end, and the callback that receives them.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_commands Commands
 *  The raw command interface (advanced, see the danger zone of VirtualC64).
 */

/** @defgroup grp_errors Errors
 *  Exceptions thrown by API functions.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_media Media files
 *  Snapshots, media files, and their types.
 */

